<body>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; width: 100%;">
    <div style="width: 60%;">
      <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;">UNIVERSITY LOGO</h1>
      <div class="content-block">
        <p>The versions as shown represent the recommended variations of the logo. The proportions and spacing of the logo must be maintained. Any alternate variations must be discussed with the Publications and Marketing Director.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 35%; text-align: right;">
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">University Image and Standards Manual</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-top: 40px;">
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold;">Reproduction</h2>
      <div class="content-block">
        <p>The logo and seal are not to be redrawn, re-proportioned, or modified in any way. The logo and seal are not to be scanned or reproduced from a previously printed version. The logo and seal are to be reproduced electronically or from line art available through the Publications Department.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="content-block">
        <p>An electronic version is available from the Publications Department.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 45%; text-align: right;">
      <div class="image-placeholder" style="width: 150px; height: auto;">
        <!-- Placeholder for Horizontal Logo -->
        <div style="font-size: 20pt; font-weight: bold;">HIU</div>
        <div style="font-size: 12pt;">HOPE INTERNATIONAL UNIVERSITY</div>
        <div style="font-size: 8pt;">Horizontal Logo</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-top: 40px;">
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold;">Typefaces</h2>
      <div class="content-block">
        <p>Uppercase <span data-field="typeface.uppercase">{{ typeface.uppercase }}</span> is the only type style to be used for the HIU in the logo.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="content-block">
        <p><span data-field="typeface.minion_pro_semibold">{{ typeface.minion_pro_semibold }}</span> is used for the name of the University.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 45%; text-align: right;">
      <div class="image-placeholder" style="width: 150px; height: auto;">
        <!-- Placeholder for Vertical Logo -->
        <div style="font-size: 20pt; font-weight: bold;">HIU</div>
        <div style="font-size: 12pt;">HOPE INTERNATIONAL UNIVERSITY</div>
        <div style="font-size: 8pt;">Vertical Logo</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-top: 40px;">
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold;">Color</h2>
      <div class="content-block">
        <p>The logo may be produced in one color or full colors. When using one color, that color should be dark enough to provide good contrast to the background, so that the logo is legible. When the logo is reproduced in full color the University's name is to be in black and the google icon and HIU should be in <span data-field="color.pantone_reference">{{ color.pantone_reference }}</span> or 4-color process: C: <span data-field="color.c_value">{{ color.c_value }}</span>, M: <span data-field="color.m_value">{{ color.m_value }}</span>, Y: <span data-field="color.y_value">{{ color.y_value }}</span>, K: <span data-field="color.k_value">{{ color.k_value }}</span>. Any variations of this coloring must first be approved by the Publications Director.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 45%; text-align: right;">
      <div class="image-placeholder" style="width: 150px; height: auto;">
        <!-- Placeholder for Icon and HIU Logo -->
        <div style="font-size: 20pt; font-weight: bold;">HIU</div>
        <div style="font-size: 12pt;">icon and HIU Logo</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-top: 40px;">
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold;">Size</h2>
      <div class="content-block">
        <p>As a general rule the logo (vertical and icon and HIU) should not be any smaller than 3/4" tall and 1" wide to insure legibility. The horizontal logo should not be any smaller than 3.5" wide.</p>
